cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "orbit-rv: a pipelined RV64IMA core with Sv39 MMU, caches and interrupts in Amaranth HDL"
abstract: "A 5-stage in-order RV64IMA_Zicsr_Zifencei core with M/S/U modes, Sv39 MMU, I/D caches, a CLINT/PLIC/UART SoC, a golden ISS used for commit-by-commit lockstep, riscv-tests compliance runs, ECP5 synthesis and an orbit-os port."
authors:
  - name: "the orbit-rv authors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/coopersimpson101-debug/orbit-rv"
keywords:
  - risc-v
  - cpu
  - fpga
  - amaranth
  - hdl
  - ecp5
